5:["$","div",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Zug is one of the most important business centres in Switzerland and home of the Crypto Valley. International business people, tax advisors and tech entrepreneurs shape the cityscape. But the historic old town with the Zytturm clock tower and Lake Zug also attracts visitors. Nova Taxi serves both worlds."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Our drivers know the business district around the train station as well as the residential neighbourhoods such as Zugerberg, Walchwilerstrasse and Inneri. We pick you up on time and guarantee absolute discretion during business meetings."}]]}]
